Sounds bad to me. We have many hundred 600 and 300X alphas here and have seen
similar problems. Its is probably a bad comms board or main board which can
only be solved by DEC, I assume you have no warrenty.

On thing to try though, connect a VT terminal using RS423 to the back of the 
system and set the alternate console DIP swicth to down. If you still get
nothing then I'm afraid you'll have to reach deep in your pockets and DEC to 
get the main board or whatever replaced.


