decladebug is not a graphical debugger. It is a debugger which
supports multiple languages. You need it when you use C++. (dbx
does not support C++) There is a graphical interface through DEC Fuse
available.

One problem I have with decladebug is with core files of
multithreaded C++ applications. It is very hard and often impossible
to get the information out of the core. What I heard from DEC
engineering is that there will be some improvements in the future.



