Summary:

I asked, if there is a posibillity to print several copies of ione =
document on a remote printer with a perinter-server card, like =
HPJetDirect, Lantronix MPS1 or Emulex.

The answers were all the same contents: Because of problems with remote =
printing protocols and memory of the printers it is not supported to =
print several copies remotely. 
Most of the UN*X OS are not capable of it incuding DigitalUNIX. You have =
to modify, if possible, the application to do several printjobs. Only =
using a HP-UX machine, that handles remote-printer differently, you can =
print several copies.

It might be possible to write a program, that catches the printjob and =
copies it several times to the printer, but it is not implemented =
anywhere yet.

Robert

