/usr/sys/BINARY/fifo_vnops.o    subset OSFBIN350
CHECKSUM: 21648     72     RCS: 4.3.44.2
------------------------------------------------

PATCH ID:  OSF350-008       Subset(s): OSFBIN350

INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS:

A kernel re-build required.


PROBLEM:    (Patch ID: OSF350-008)      (HPXQ71268)
********
Processes that do fcntl() operations on pipes will sometimes
hang when trying to exit or become zombies (defunct processes).
Customers using Interleaf are strongly urged to apply this patch.


