Thanks to everyone who responded. 
Innd needs to be patched for DEC Alphas due to the 64-bit architecture
specifics.  Refer to UNOFF-NOTES/DEC-alpha file (in INN-1.4unoff4
distribution) for instructions; quoting the above mentioned file:

one set of changes that have to be made.  Find all uses of inet_addr
(innd/rc.c, lib/remopen.c, backends/rcompress.c) and replace the
related "unsigned long" declarations or casts with "unsigned int".

Good luck,
